    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b55589760adf3e35fe11216",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，祖母！我要开始啰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a1aa109ed966400aabbeda256130f1578402df8ee3d169301f3a36fec5e47d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1044/storytimeline_041044002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d79f4aa57c995b8868896ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最重要的是──在听完她的故事之后，\n我觉得自己稍微能够理解她祖母的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eba50e2ee6b721d8b2221d7505dbef32d896681809494b51a45ec0d3818d509",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1044/storytimeline_041044002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38122a6af3b6e97b4885c388",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论表现得再怎么好，她学的那些才艺都无法让她感到快乐。\n这一定是因为那些并非她自己“想做”的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a71521bd48718743d3f890d088fe0e3e505d7e60d5b018ec6ecfd7ecd85410",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1044/storytimeline_041044002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84341a0da657f613c8b237a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "重点是要让她自己有“想做”的动机。\n所以她的祖母才施展魔法给她看，让她产生“想做”的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b08e8a5c3b79755d9c3c67cd6d5c44b0b5c247506d0215e12cfef6eb6107b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1044/storytimeline_041044002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72a50054aed02fbf404dfa11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革就这样自己做出决定，\n因为自己“想做”而投身赛跑的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddd447bdf890220c29fe1001304930dbae84dcd8d8c2cd5debce97210b6b3e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
